            "review_title": "Review at KFC",
            "review_text": "Joe W\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam13 contributions\n0\nDisappointing Experience\nMay 2018 • Solo\nI ordered chicken from KFC and I am very disappointed with my experience. I ordered to have it delivered and I waited 1 hour and 10 minutes before I got my food. I live within 0.6 km of the nearest restaurant. I ordered 6 items and I have no idea why it took 70 minutes for me to get my food. Had I known of the delay, I would have walked to get it and still would have gotten it 40 minutes sooner. It's simply pathetic. This experience has made me not want to come back to this franchise again. I will also go out of my way to convince my friends and family to never use KFC again. Just terrible!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 3, 2018",
