            "review_title": "Review at KFC",
            "review_text": "Gojoban\nHilo, Hawaii149 contributions\n1\nOnline Ordering and Delivery\nApr 2018 • Solo\nThis review is for KFC online ordering and delivery. While I think KFC chicken is good I can not say the same for their online ordering. I placed an order at 11:38 and received and email saying order received and being processed. Online showed around 11:50 and then a minute or two later I received another email saying they are processing my order as fast as possible and will get it within 30 min. I called them and was told they did not get an order from me and then the order was deleted my my order history. I called them and all I got was let me check and you hang up and we will call you back. Got the called back and just oh so sorry this happened.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 26, 2018",
